  "question": {
    "text": "The quadratic equation whose roots are the arithmetic mean&nbsp;and the harmonic mean&nbsp;of the roots of the equation <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> is"
